Package: flamenco-greeter
Version: 0.4.0-1
Architecture: all
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Niruxx <niruxx@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/niruxx/Flamenco-Greeter
Depends: greetd, python3 (>= 3.11), quickshell, qml6-module-qtquick,
 qml6-module-qtquick-effects, qml6-module-qtquick-layouts,
 systemd | systemd-standalone-sysusers, systemd | systemd-standalone-tmpfiles
Suggests: flamenco-shell, niri | hyprland | sway, fprintd, libpam-fprintd,
 qml6-module-qtmultimedia, ffmpeg, upower
Description: greetd login screen for Flamenco Shell
 Flamenco Greeter is a Quickshell login screen for greetd. It reuses the
 installed Flamenco Shell theme, widgets, and assets. Install Flamenco Shell
 system-wide under /usr for the greeter to find its QML components.
